    "text": "Join us 🔴LIVE🔴 Today, November 10th,  from 2:00 p.m. CDT / 20:00 UTC on NSF’s Starbase Live stream for a potential launch week Raptorside Chat.\nWe’ll discuss all the latest developments at Starbase and beyond and try to answer any questions you may have!\nnsf.live/starbase",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nasaspaceflight.com/post/3mzy42bbhxc27",
    "image": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Ayifpqamzwvp3g4szr44mz37r/bafkreifgr7nvlj2sj3ua6er4kacj32ntv5ohwiusu5auvwk2tfsinxzfdq/thumbnail.jpg",
