    "platform": "bluesky",
    "author": "NASASpaceflight.com",
    "handle": "nasaspaceflight.com",
    "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:yifpqamzwvp3g4szr44mz37r/bafkreic7pwkmzswncacrgd7sp2zpyfdzijbvn5ai4sznhcj6b6wi7vjx54",
    "text": "This Week In Spaceflight: NASA announced Moon contracts, including lunar Starlink satellites; Blue Origin unveiled work on a New Glenn third stage and a new booster engine; SpaceX is prepping for Starship’s first double-catch mission, and more!\n\nPremiering now on YouTube: youtu.be/CzE778bLceg",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nasaspaceflight.com/post/3mzw5xoqaj22i",
